# Low-level term of the DLPNO-CCSD(T) : r2SCAN-3c composite correction,
# COMPUTATIONAL.md C8 (K + H2O2 -> KP, item 1).
#
# Species: reactant pre-complex, `displace_minus` conformer.
#
# r2SCAN-3c single point on the SAME 22-atom QM-region fragment as
# ../dlpno-ccsdt/job.xyz, in CPCM(Water); subtracted from the DLPNO energy to
# give the correction added to the embedded G(r2SCAN-3c/xtb). It is the same
# method the full-system geometry/TS/Hessian tier used, so the difference is a
# pure level-of-theory correction. See ../dlpno-ccsdt/job.inp for the formula.
! r2SCAN-3c CPCM(Water) TightSCF

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
